 The cycle illustrates a possible deadlock only if these hold/wait conditions can actually arise.
 Evaluate consistent acquisition order or revised transaction scope; test actual engine behavior.
 Bounded local retry is safe only under preserved command identity and proven effect boundaries.
 No Petri-net reachability or formal deadlock-freedom proof is claimed.
endlegend
